# Library Event Registration System (LERS)

## IMS566 – Advanced Web Design Development and Content Management

### Group Project

---

# Project Overview

Library Event Registration System (LERS) is a web-based application developed to manage library events and participant registrations digitally. The system replaces manual registration forms with an online platform that allows administrators to manage events while participants can register easily through a responsive web interface.

The system is developed as part of the IMS566 Group Assignment.

---

# Objectives

* Digitalise library event registration process.
* Manage library events efficiently.
* Allow users to register online.
* Record participant attendance.
* Generate participant reports.
* Demonstrate CRUD implementation using CodeIgniter Framework.

